cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AI Investment Proposal Generator"
abstract: >-
  React and Vite application that uses Google Gemini to synthesize embedded research summaries
  and Google Search grounding to retrieve market context for a technical capabilities report.
  The application prompt asks the model to extrapolate descriptions, so generated claims require
  independent review against their cited primary sources.
